<title>GERMANY: Citibank issues Deutsche Telekom options.</title>
<headline>Citibank issues Deutsche Telekom options.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank in Germany said on Monday it launched two tranches of five million American-style call options in Deutsche Telekom shares on a strike basis of 30/35 marks and 40/45 marks, with expiry of June 25.</p>
<p>Citibank said it has also issued a put option on a strike basis of 30 marks, with an expiry date of July 1, 2002.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
